&trans                &trans                &trans                &trans                &trans                &kp LC(LA(LS(J)))     &trans                  &kp LG(Z)             &kp LG(LS(Z))           &kp LSHFT             &kp ESCAPE              &trans                &kp LA(LEFT)          &kp LG(DOWN)          &kp LG(UP)            &kp LA(RIGHT)         &kp LC(LA(LS(E)))     &trans
