&kp LEFT_SHIFT  &kp X      &kp J   &kp COMMA       &kp EQUAL  &kp SINGLE_QUOTE                        &kp LEFT_SHIFT    &macro_caps_mac                       &kp C   &kp M         &kp W           &kp V           &kp DOT   &kp RSHFT
